{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And He closed flesh beneath it.</b> Our Sages of blessed memory interpreted: once the woman was created, the Satan was created with her — from the beginning of the Book. And therefore you will not find the letter ס (samekh) [in the Torah, from Genesis 1:1 onward], to teach you that once the woman was created, the Satan was created with her. And if you object: the סובב — that one is written in the rivers [i.e., it occurs later, in the section of the rivers]."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:09:31.383427056Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}